   "text": "University of Sussex International Study Centre - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nUniversity of Sussex International Study Centre\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nThe University of Sussex is a leading higher education and research institution located in the popular student city Brighton. It was ranked 62nd in Europe and 147th in the world by the Times Higher Education World University Rankings 2018, and was ranked 228th in the world according to the QS World University Rankings 2018.\nInternational students can take a foundation course on campus in order to progress onto the degree of their choice at the university.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n31/03/2026 11:33\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n31/03/2026 11:33\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £17,956.00\nMin: £17,284.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n20%\n3,900 of 19,500 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nStudy Group\nFounded Year\n1961\nCampus(es)\nBrighton\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n01/04/2026\nContract End Date\n31/12/2026\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rVkJhxeD6Lk\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
